hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"201","We are Abu Zuhayr Abdul Majeed bin Ibrahim Al-Masry, we are Al-Muqri, we are Saeed bin Abi Ayyub, on the authority of Abu Al-Aswad, who is Muhammad bin Abd al-Rahman, the client of the Nawfal family, the orphan of Urwa ibn al-Zubayr, on the authority of Abbad ibn Tamim, on the authority of his father, he said: I saw the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace. He said: “He performs ablution and wipes the water over his feet.” Abu Bakr said: Useful news, on the authority of Ibn Omar, on this topic."
